nu Lahtinen"] ", who came in as the favorite. He lost his first match to Japan’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/59078"} "Seiichi Osanai"] ", however, and later lost to Egyptian " [:a {:href "/athletes/57765"} "Salem Bekhit"] ", and thus Lahtinen was eliminated and was not classified. The final came down to Korean " [:a {:href "/athletes/59195"} "Kim Won-Gi"] " against Sweden’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/60053"} "Kent-Olle Johansson"] ". The match was quite dull, although close, with Kim winning the match in which no points were scored, taking the gold medal on tie-breaking criteria. Bronze went to Switzerland’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/59932"} "Hugo Dietsche"] ", who defeated American " [:a {:href "/athletes/60684"} "Abdurrahim Kuzu"] " on points, 8-4."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Round Eliminated"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Classification Points", :class "footnote"} "CP"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "155"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/59195"} "Kim Won-Gi"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/KOR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/KOR.png"}] "KOR"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "223"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60053"} "Kent-Olle Johansson"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "215"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/59932"} "Hugo Dietsche"]] [:td {} [:a {:hre